{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_title", "source_sha256": "e4ca694a74325cffe74e0ac87b7377165d524560ca27ef62f6f5dbb5ee5a1546", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」高槻やよい", "zh": "“与你相遇之后”高槻弥生", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_synopsis", "source_sha256": "608388848d178070cf9f900a4ea19353be21003b59dbe311e2223c551d3abece", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\nやよいとプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "在Destiny公演前夕，\n这一幕回溯了从弥生与制作人\n相遇之初至今的点点滴滴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1000_p", "source_sha256": "faa2b232182dd0529b99033cf03203aa9edf6b447952b57c93799e7b5f5357d3", "ja": "（Destiny公演のレッスンが本格化する中、今日の\nやよいは早朝生番組のロケだ。負担は大きいが……）", "zh": "（Destiny公演的训练正全面展开，今天弥生要去参加清晨直播节目的外景拍摄。虽然负担很重，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "af3c29a7198b6ef67720379d3efcdf50076f0d85ea1ff98810ec20ecef5cfaee", "ja": "おはようございまーす！　今日も朝のお仕事と\n公演のレッスン、両方がんばろー！", "zh": "早上好——！今天也要为早上的工作和公演排练一起加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1002_p", "source_sha256": "72f28ff910dc71dc68fadb5c1880893bd2865bc901e6bb5eec27939523b7dc99", "ja": "おお、朝早くても元気いっぱいだな。\nさすがやよいだ。眠くないか？", "zh": "哦，这么早就精神十足啊。真不愧是弥生。不会困吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "b7817c2c9224d5679c0e7af374473818e38a9a9155670b4c88c8aa35a91e93fe", "ja": "はいっ、バッチリです！　朝ごはんもいっぱい\n食べたし、元気モリモリですよっ。", "zh": "没问题，状态正佳！早餐也吃得饱饱的，现在精神十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "92894912cf62fbb4e1edaca10c89ece9229cde2848ea28076a0694502bdaab51", "ja": "{$P$}も、ちゃんと朝ごはん、\n食べてきましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}也是否有好好吃了\n早饭才来的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1005_p", "source_sha256": "80a7a41a8771579bd26fde8dcdbf35d59cfae1b9c95680c151488897c1a00b6e", "ja": "もちろん。だから元気モリモリだ！", "zh": "当然。我已经吃过早饭了，所以精神十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "d389ad392339de4b167292c09d7d943c11014ab8e5eca6c47202e9d4025d8a6e", "ja": "えへへっ、よかったー♪\nじゃあ一緒ですね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n那我们就一样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f08f498827853e8ef74220e46fc979b511fc847b38335b7c64dd3e0950f6bb8f", "ja": "忙しくて大変だと思うけど、\n元気の力で乗り越えていこうな。", "zh": "虽然我知道你很忙，也会很辛苦，但我们一起靠精神和活力克服过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "6599e59ad2b5eb7307389377550e7344f1110f0036fe654fdf377ef455997068", "ja": "まかせてください！　私、忙しいほうが\nぶわわわわーって、元気が出ますから。", "zh": "就交给我吧！我越是忙碌，\n就越会呼啦一下涌出精神来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "a5138b5deed0e48e04209ad076bccdc16d374ed53784d6ebcaf6dc816d41d38c", "ja": "あ、でも、忙しくなくても元気かも。\nやることなかったら、掃除とかしちゃいますし！", "zh": "啊，不过就算不忙，我可能也很有精神。\n要是没什么事可做，我还会去打扫之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5fe7435f557beaf785a78698222f9b74d80ae3189e942fe7e289c1ce80accbad", "ja": "そういえば……、\nやよいと初めて会った時も、そんな感じだったな。", "zh": "说起来……第一次见到弥生的时候，好像也是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "f725c763c1cc62054011a8b0e5f774fccb1d35dcfdbdb9e7f367b1df63797005", "ja": "はー、これで掃き掃除、終わりー！\nつぎは窓ふき、がんばろー！", "zh": "哈——这样一来，扫地就结束啦！\n接下来要努力擦窗户啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "138ba093141283288e794fd2a790e1b2cc6f7ae64bcda57e764491192ba78952", "ja": "えへへっ、そうですね！　あの頃は、\nあんまりやることなくて、ずーっと掃除してました。", "zh": "嘿嘿，说得对！那时候也没什么事情可做，就一直在打扫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "17293d34cef38001c4a9a9138e5fd4e2b1f4e7514c8ec6b66807bcc6fdebcc89", "ja": "今は時間がなくて、劇場のお掃除もみんなと同じぐらい\nしかできなくて、残念ですけど……。", "zh": "现在没什么时间，没法像大家一样多打扫一会儿剧场，真遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "76e55d7c9fe545e7dd9af7c39c5e3f2f697dae0066af4d4b509bd884de138e4a", "ja": "でもお給料がもらえてるから、よかったなーって。\nごはんのおかずも、たまに一品増やせるんですよ！", "zh": "不过因为能拿到工资，所以我觉得真是太好了～。连吃饭时的菜，有时候都能多加一道呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d76219e1a127760388c72593aae7bdae961d3ba9c23928889fcb037eaafcaadf", "ja": "おお、それはよかった。\nアイドルになった甲斐があったな。", "zh": "哦，那真是太好了。成为偶像也算是值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "7cb8ebeaa2ae76ad88ee18781b8fd3466716b3a0ebe7c32c4fa1915aa57bd3e0", "ja": "はいっ。あとシール貼ってないのにお肉を買ったり、\n特売じゃないのにもやしを買ったり！", "zh": "是！还有明明没贴打折标签却买了肉，明明不是特价也买了豆芽菜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "f64bfb20f037df39387d6a4b04a38e9df37b6efa87fd3a215a89911f04d6175d", "ja": "はあ……、ゼイタクです～。", "zh": "唉……太奢侈了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4d5d1298e9c6fce5d9e587d553e7badcd5e210cb3e434f4aad070871dcaa43bf", "ja": "ゼイタク……かもしれないけど、それもやよいが\n頑張った成果だ。たっぷりゼイタクしていいんだぞ？", "zh": "奢侈……或许是有点奢侈，但那也是弥生努力得来的成果。尽情享受这份奢侈也没关系哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "f7649bd932586b45bdc9f5294ddb8848c6e4c0fa3bf531794b026c5f767667a3", "ja": "はわっ、たっぷりですか！？　ううう、でも～……。\nそれは怖いから、ちょっとだけにしておきますねっ。", "zh": "呀，满满的吗！？呜呜呜，可是～……\n因为那样太可怕了，所以还是只用一点点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fe02544f36884c53c04166b68198658d0b0ca0297315eec1fb1be7567f8a5ade", "ja": "はは、やよいらしいな。\nまぁ、一気に使うよりはいいと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，真像弥生的作风啊。\n不过，我觉得比起一下子用光，还是少用一点比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "11865b7c258890d9f837cf67b82454f9788d417a99623fed795a2b6b06af820f", "ja": "それに……お仕事は、{$P$}が、\nいっぱいとってきてくれるから、できるんですよね？", "zh": "而且……因为{$P$}会帮我接来很多工作，所以才能做到，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "d4638dd2c57a94ef1b5e2a49418a0afca2896138212b8119d3f4b03a327aac2c", "ja": "今日のテレビのお仕事もですけど、あと、\n大きな会社のタイアップとか、観光大使とか！", "zh": "今天的电视工作也是，还有大公司的联动合作、观光大使之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "10b16047248eebae9f918d41be3150b52be34b657808d331d974102d8615b871", "ja": "どのお仕事もすっごく楽しくて、お給料までもらえて。\n全部、{$P$}のおかげかなーって。", "zh": "每一份工作都特别开心，还能拿到工资。我觉得，这全都是多亏了{$P$}呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a1939b49ed4b8be4737a600f3163613931a76e6add3306af3c66d958e10ae7f4", "ja": "そんなことはないけど、そんな風にアイドルを楽しんで\nくれてるなら、こっちも張り合いがあるかな。", "zh": "也不是那样，不过你要是能这样享受偶像活动，\n我这边也会更有干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "e08f8aeac017affb8e7754602061b892537366304911029a559faf3780c809a7", "ja": "はい、楽しいです！\nもちろん、大変なこともいっぱいありますけどー。", "zh": "是的，很开心！\n当然，也有很多辛苦的事情啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "697e84f89d8f34eb1f5426730424ce50dbe3eea35d7bc72f31d43f13ada8c01a", "ja": "がんばればがんばるほど、仲間のみんなも、妹も弟達も\nファンのみんなも、すっごく喜んでくれて。", "zh": "越努力，伙伴们、弟弟妹妹们，还有粉丝们，大家就会越开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "b564afe08b0ee88eadd0787402cc042f02fa93c4ceca3c12ffa9b76200a1bd61", "ja": "それがうれしくて、ますます元気になって、\nもっともっとがんばれたりして。だからー。", "zh": "因为那样让我很开心，也变得越来越有精神，还能更加努力。所以——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "8d0163d51921b3d871f480cfdbc4e69119e6feedd1b55b12e0911fc4429e852b", "ja": "私、アイドルになれて、本当によかったです♪", "zh": "我能成为偶像，真的太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7e52f54a1be4a0d685d6c8fbb6b72355bc1eb771829986410651aa8b542ba9f0", "ja": "そっか……。", "zh": "这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ca54d92ae28106c09772f62ba87b321915feb39919cc28a4b184c1382d0bf1ff", "ja": "よし！　じゃあもっともっと頑張ってもらうため、\nまずは手始めに、今日一日をしっかり頑張ろう！", "zh": "好！那么为了让你更有干劲，\n首先第一步，今天这一整天就好好努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1031_005yay", "source_sha256": "78370d1ba05bd432078eb9487675a4e8d981112702e0b30976ee64b813751ff3", "ja": "はーい！　じゃあ今日も一日、\n一緒に頑張りましょう、の～～～。", "zh": "好——！那今天一整天也一起加油吧～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0442_story_005yay_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_005yay_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "3c25710c4aa60c77e92cef8eece4c5ed074dffb1ab0db92dd3515472d3b3bf41", "ja": "ハイ、ターッチ！　いぇい！", "zh": "好，击──掌！耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
